Checked by reading the code:
(a) every solver job (solve) and march job (march) gets its own tempfile.mkdtemp directory under WORK, removed after use; cake_lpr runs on the files in the solver job's directory.
(b) finalize() writes leaves.icnf and open.icnf via tempfile.mkstemp in the output dir, then os.replace into place.
(c) the first record of a new leaves.jsonl is {"case": --name, "case_sha256": sha256 of CASE.cnf}; run with --name U3_L.
Also: a leaf enters leaves.icnf only when cake_lpr printed exactly "s VERIFIED UNSAT" (AUDIT BUG-1); other verdicts are UNSAT_UNCHECKED and stay open.
